WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.376
Every single lonely night, the young boy desperately wished time would just stop.

2
00:00:05.376 --> 00:00:11.423
Then one strange afternoon, his impossible wish actually came true in total silence.

3
00:00:11.423 --> 00:00:16.608
He could suddenly freeze everything around him including heavy rain and moving people.

4
00:00:16.608 --> 00:00:22.271
At first, wielding this incredible cosmic power made him feel like an almighty god.

5
00:00:22.271 --> 00:00:27.479
He easily used his amazing gift to win every fight and avoid all pain.

6
00:00:27.479 --> 00:00:33.503
Slowly, a deeply terrifying realization began to dawn on his troubled young mind.

7
00:00:33.503 --> 00:00:39.119
Every time time stopped, someone he truly loved permanently forgot a memory of him.

8
00:00:39.119 --> 00:00:44.663
First his best friend forgot their childhood, and then his loving mother forgot his name.

9
00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:50.663
Deeply desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered his heartbreaking truth aloud.

10
00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:56.159
He let time flow again, choosing to finally grow older instead of living forever.
